# Healing the Land (sandoria 82): the other answers at Eperdur, Progress events of quest containers that come before
# his script (and his DefaultActions 678) on every talk. Altana's Sorrow (C#) accepted with the Letter from Virnage:
# 679 at fame level 4, main level 10 (not 681); its finish completes it (Scroll of Teleport-Dem, the letter taken).
# Then the lookup's 678 and the script's 681. Acting in Good Faith (Lua) accepted with Gantineux's Letter: 680; its
# finish completes it (Scroll of Teleport-Mea). Then 678, the script's 681.
char zone=NorthernSanDoria pos=126.3,-6.5,95.7 job=WAR lvl=10
fame Sandoria 225
quest Bastok.AltanasSorrow accepted
keyitem LetterFromVirnage
login
trigger Eperdur                           # Altana's Sorrow: 679
finish-if-event                           # Altana's Sorrow completed
trigger Eperdur                           # 678
finish-if-event
trigger Eperdur                           # the script: 681
finish-if-event option=1                  # declined
quest Windurst.ActingInGoodFaith accepted
keyitem GantineuxsLetter
trigger Eperdur                           # Acting in Good Faith: 680
finish-if-event                           # Acting in Good Faith completed
trigger Eperdur                           # 678
finish-if-event
trigger Eperdur                           # the script: 681
finish-if-event option=1                  # declined
